    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>Main story</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/b923dec21203ec54f5e94441472db1ae.poster.avif?t=1753039430\" width=610 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/b923dec21203ec54f5e94441472db1ae.webm?t=1753039430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/b923dec21203ec54f5e94441472db1ae.mp4?t=1753039430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a police officer assigned to investigate an earthquake at the renowned &quot;Santa Margarita&quot; school at year 2003.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/cc488da7d8c6ecd1538cfebb65af9a0c.poster.avif?t=1753039430\" width=610 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/cc488da7d8c6ecd1538cfebb65af9a0c.webm?t=1753039430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/cc488da7d8c6ecd1538cfebb65af9a0c.mp4?t=1753039430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Your mission is to uncover the truth behind the incident and reveal the school's dark, hidden history. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your investigation, you'll encounter various paranormal events that defy explanation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/8af3a5c8e515519b779dbbd9fec91821.poster.avif?t=1753039430\" width=610 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/8af3a5c8e515519b779dbbd9fec91821.webm?t=1753039430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/8af3a5c8e515519b779dbbd9fec91821.mp4?t=1753039430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or can you unravel the mysteries? Additionally, you must complete a small list of puzzles that you must discover throughout the first floor of the school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/37ebb4160c22d1a33b99deeca926b828.poster.avif?t=1753039430\" width=610 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/37ebb4160c22d1a33b99deeca926b828.webm?t=1753039430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/37ebb4160c22d1a33b99deeca926b828.mp4?t=1753039430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Game features:</i></strong>  </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duration of 1.5 hours </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS style </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set on Halloween dates </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NORMAL level puzzles </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains gory material and may be sensitive for some audiences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>THE GAME WILL BE GETTING MORE CONTENT AS UPDATES GO BY</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did you enjoy this game?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then take a look at our new project:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Dr. Dreams Simulator</strong><br>A game where you enter your patients\u2019 dreams to help them overcome their nightmares.<br>\u2192 <strong>Add it to your Steam wishlist!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/da092eeab6c1873250bbf41264cc59bb.avif?t=1753039430\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contact the team: <strong><a href=\"mailto:papus.studio2024@gmail.com\">papus.studio2024@gmail.com</a></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will be happy to bring you new content and solve problems in future updates!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><i><strong>Main story</strong></i></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/b923dec21203ec54f5e94441472db1ae.poster.avif?t=1753039430\" width=610 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/b923dec21203ec54f5e94441472db1ae.webm?t=1753039430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/b923dec21203ec54f5e94441472db1ae.mp4?t=1753039430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a police officer assigned to investigate an earthquake at the renowned &quot;Santa Margarita&quot; school at year 2003.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/cc488da7d8c6ecd1538cfebb65af9a0c.poster.avif?t=1753039430\" width=610 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/cc488da7d8c6ecd1538cfebb65af9a0c.webm?t=1753039430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/cc488da7d8c6ecd1538cfebb65af9a0c.mp4?t=1753039430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Your mission is to uncover the truth behind the incident and reveal the school's dark, hidden history. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your investigation, you'll encounter various paranormal events that defy explanation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/8af3a5c8e515519b779dbbd9fec91821.poster.avif?t=1753039430\" width=610 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/8af3a5c8e515519b779dbbd9fec91821.webm?t=1753039430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/8af3a5c8e515519b779dbbd9fec91821.mp4?t=1753039430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or can you unravel the mysteries? Additionally, you must complete a small list of puzzles that you must discover throughout the first floor of the school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/37ebb4160c22d1a33b99deeca926b828.poster.avif?t=1753039430\" width=610 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/37ebb4160c22d1a33b99deeca926b828.webm?t=1753039430\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/37ebb4160c22d1a33b99deeca926b828.mp4?t=1753039430\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Game features:</i></strong>  </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duration of 1.5 hours </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS style </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set on Halloween dates </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NORMAL level puzzles </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains gory material and may be sensitive for some audiences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>THE GAME WILL BE GETTING MORE CONTENT AS UPDATES GO BY</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did you enjoy this game?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then take a look at our new project:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Dr. Dreams Simulator</strong><br>A game where you enter your patients\u2019 dreams to help them overcome their nightmares.<br>\u2192 <strong>Add it to your Steam wishlist!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3228230/extras/da092eeab6c1873250bbf41264cc59bb.avif?t=1753039430\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contact the team: <strong><a href=\"mailto:papus.studio2024@gmail.com\">papus.studio2024@gmail.com</a></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will be happy to bring you new content and solve problems in future updates!</p>",
    "short_description": "A horror game set in a school, in which you will be a police officer who will have to investigate an earthquake. You will have to complete puzzles and face the paranormal events that occur. You have to be careful, the school covers a fairly dark past that you will be able to discover.",
